{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retromine is an <strong>ultra-satisfying, highly replayable, tough-as-nails deckbuilding roguelike.</strong> Delve into the caves, mine resources, and escape before the caverns collapse! Spend ore to buy new cards, upgrade your deck, and discover powerful synergies on your way to the bottom of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/extras/a2b697512b95968bc6b435663a1c0519.poster.avif?t=1774567673\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/extras/a2b697512b95968bc6b435663a1c0519.webm?t=1774567673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/extras/a2b697512b95968bc6b435663a1c0519.mp4?t=1774567673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FRESH TAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retromine is <strong>a</strong> <strong>brand new roguelike deckbuilding experience</strong> for fans who love the genre, but find their favorite games growing stale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike deckbuilding:</strong> Delve into the mines, play cards to mine resources, and escape with your life - then use those resources to buy new cards, upgrade your deck, and power up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strike a perfect balance: </strong>Survive by mining scorium to narrowly escape danger, get stronger by mining ore to buy new cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover powerful synergies: </strong>Unearth super-powered synergies and exploit game breaking combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your mettle:</strong> Challenge yourself and put your decision making and problem solving abilities to the test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter flow state:</strong>\u00a0Unwind with an experience expressly created to place you in a state of meditative deep focus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig your way to mastery:</strong>\u00a0Collect over 100 unique resource, tool, and action cards to use on your expeditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your run:</strong> Harness the power of over 10 unique utility cards to change the way you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself:</strong>\u00a0Tunnel through a curious subterranean fantasy beneath a classic retro-pixel aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamy, hypnotic synthwave:</strong>\u00a0Relax with over 40 minutes of soothing synthwave music by Airglow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIG, DIE, LEARN, REPEAT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy infinite procedurally generated content</strong> in a game specifically designed for <strong>endless replayability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/extras/e60c8c3043aa90dd195b234b2e3b6744.poster.avif?t=1774567673\" width=767 height=141 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/extras/e60c8c3043aa90dd195b234b2e3b6744.webm?t=1774567673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4061320?t=1774567673","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/37799b1f8f9e1753d8677e709e9a14e95a967c4d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774567673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/91615a7773a3af0b47a930740aac02696cf3a103/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774567673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/91615a7773a3af0b47a930740aac02696cf3a103/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774567673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retromine is an <strong>ultra-satisfying, highly replayable, tough-as-nails deckbuilding roguelike.</strong> Delve into the caves, mine resources, and escape before the caverns collapse! Spend ore to buy new cards, upgrade your deck, and discover powerful synergies on your way to the bottom of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/extras/a2b697512b95968bc6b435663a1c0519.poster.avif?t=1774567673\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/extras/a2b697512b95968bc6b435663a1c0519.webm?t=1774567673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061320/extras/a2b697512b95968bc6b435663a1c0519.mp4?t=1774567673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FRESH TAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retromine is <strong>a</strong> <strong>brand new roguelike deckbuilding experience</strong> for fans who love the genre, but find their favorite games growing stale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike deckbuilding:</strong> Delve into the mines, play cards to mine resources, and escape with your life - then use those resources to buy new cards, upgrade your deck, and power up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strike a perfect balance: </strong>Survive by mining scorium to narrowly escape danger, get stronger by mining ore to buy new cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover powerful synergies: </strong>Unearth super-powered synergies and exploit game breaking combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your mettle:</strong> Challenge yourself and put your decision making and problem solving abilities to the test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter flow state:</strong>\u00a0Unwind with an experience expressly created to place you in a state of meditative deep focus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig your way to mastery:</strong>\u00a0Collect over 100 unique resource, tool, and action cards to use on your expeditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your run:</strong> Harness the power of over 10 unique utility cards to change the way you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself:</strong>\u00a0Tunnel through a curious subterranean fantasy beneath a classic retro-pixel aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamy, hypnotic synthwave:</strong>\u00a0Relax with over 40 minutes of soothing synthwave music by Airglow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIG, DIE, LEARN, REPEAT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy infinite procedurally generated content</strong> in a game specifically designed for <strong>endless replayability.</stron